# VHDL: IEEE 1076-2019, 15 Lexical elements, 15.10 Reserved words; requirements/languages/vhdl.md
name     vhdl vhd

keyword  abs access after alias all and architecture array assert attribute begin block body buffer bus
keyword  case component configuration constant disconnect downto else elsif end entity exit file for
keyword  function generate generic group guarded if impure in inertial inout is label library linkage
keyword  literal loop map mod nand new next nor not null of on open or others out package port postponed
keyword  procedure process pure range record register reject rem report return rol ror select severity
keyword  signal shared sla sll sra srl subtype then to transport type unaffected units until use variable
keyword  wait when while with xnor xor
type     std_logic std_logic_vector std_ulogic unsigned signed integer natural positive boolean bit
type     bit_vector real time string character
builtin  true false rising_edge falling_edge to_integer to_unsigned resize
fold-case

line-comment   --
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : doubled
prefix   x X b B o O
number        : no-leading-dot
operators  +-*/&|<>=:
calls
hook     apostrophe
